  "description": "Bring an immediate sense of bold modernity, retro-editorial chic, and high-impact graphic style to your text blocks with Ragmont Serif, a premium variable typeface family! Perfectly merging heavy, playful structural curves with razor-sharp editorial serifs, this highly dynamic font features an outstanding contrast between ultra-chunky letter stems and crisp, delicate terminals. It is especially notable for its expressive lower terminal loops and sweeping swoops that inject a vibrant, contemporary attitude into classic serif geometry.\nRagmont Serif functions as a premier creative centerpoint for contemporary luxury branding systems, trendy fashion magazine headers, sleek lifestyle product packaging, bold tech company marketing campaigns, and eye-catching exhibition posters.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring an immediate sense of bold modernity, retro-editorial chic, and high-impact graphic style to your text blocks with Ragmont Serif, a premium variable typeface family! Perfectly merging heavy, playful structural curves with razor-sharp editorial serifs, this highly dynamic font features an outstanding contrast between ultra-chunky letter stems and crisp, delicate terminals. It is especially notable for its expressive lower terminal loops and sweeping swoops that inject a vibrant, contemporary attitude into classic serif geometry.</p>\n<p>Ragmont Serif functions as a premier creative centerpoint for contemporary luxury branding systems, trendy fashion magazine headers, sleek lifestyle product packaging, bold tech company marketing campaigns, and eye-catching exhibition posters.</p>",
